    <innernamespace refid="namespaceasyncdb">asyncdb</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Maps exceptions from the Drogon async database path to the HTTP statuses of the synchronous path. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This header declares three small helpers that inspect an exception. One decides whether the error means &quot;the database is busy&quot;, one turns that decision into an HTTP status code, and one throws the project&apos;s <ref refid="classDatabaseBusy" kindref="compound">DatabaseBusy</ref> exception so the rest of the server can keep a single error-handling path.</para>
<para>WHY THIS FILE MATTERS IN THE SERVER: The controller methods that use Drogon coroutines catch errors as the generic std::exception type, so they lose the specific Drogon exception class. These helpers recover the important distinction: a busy pool or a timeout means &quot;try again later&quot; (HTTP 503 <ref refid="classService" kindref="compound">Service</ref> Unavailable), while any other failure is a normal internal error (HTTP 500). They let the async database path answer failures exactly the same way the older synchronous path does. Without this file, a temporary database overload would be reported as a generic server error instead of a retryable one, and callers would not know to back off.</para>
<para>CONCEPTS TO LEARN (for beginners):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>C++20 coroutines: <ulink url="https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/coroutines">https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/coroutines</ulink></para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Exceptions and std::exception: <ulink url="https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/error/exception">https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/error/exception</ulink></para>
</listitem><listitem><para>dynamic_cast (checking an object&apos;s real type at runtime): <ulink url="https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/dynamic_cast">https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/dynamic_cast</ulink></para>
</listitem><listitem><para>HTTP 503 status: <ulink url="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Status/503">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Status/503</ulink></para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Drogon DbClient: <ulink url="https://drogon.docsforge.com/master/database/">https://drogon.docsforge.com/master/database/</ulink></para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Amr Osman <ulink url="mailto:dr3mro@gmail.com">dr3mro@gmail.com</ulink> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2026-11-16 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
